WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.615 --> 00:00:03.465
Lesson twelve. Weather!

2
00:00:04.232 --> 00:00:11.132
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.079 --> 00:00:13.543
Coco, look at the sky!

4
00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:15.220
Let's learn the weather!

5
00:00:16.241 --> 00:00:19.741
Sun! Say it with me. Sun!

6
00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:27.225
Rain! Say it with me. Rain!

7
00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:34.782
Cloud! Say it with me. Cloud!

8
00:00:39.008 --> 00:00:42.508
Wind! Say it with me. Wind!

9
00:00:46.262 --> 00:00:49.412
Hot! Say it with me. Hot!

10
00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.744
Cold! Say it with me. Cold!

11
00:01:00.781 --> 00:01:03.265
The sun is out. It's hot!

12
00:01:07.272 --> 00:01:09.640
Oh! It's raining!

13
00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:10.756
Where's my umbrella?

14
00:01:10.806 --> 00:01:11.956
Here it is!

15
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:19.380
It's cold! Brrr! Hug yourself!

16
00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.280
It's hot! Fan your face!

17
00:01:24.944 --> 00:01:31.577
This is L. L is for lion. Lion! L is for leaf. Leaf!

18
00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:43.075
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

19
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.883
Bye-bye, friends!

